        "id": 149947,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-11T23:18:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Animus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/48/1887_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Animus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Cool beans.I am familiar with the Fainting Goat Game's line and Mike's work. You now have piqued my curiosity as to your identity.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No secret identities necessary here! &nbsp;</p>\n<p>My name is Andy Klosky. &nbsp;Much of my written work is done as A.P. Klosky. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have a number of credits with a handful of RPG and board game companies, but my biggest work is hands-down&nbsp;<em>Cold Steel Wardens: Roleplaying in the Iron Age of Comics</em>.</p>",
