        "created_at": "2015-11-13T02:02:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>PlatinumWarlock wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>but my biggest work is hands-down&nbsp;<em>Cold Steel Wardens: Roleplaying in the Iron Age of Comics</em>.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhich is a pretty awesome take on the grim and gritty side of the superhero universe.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thankee, sai!</p>\n<p>I'm really excited about the next book in the&nbsp;<em>CSW&nbsp;</em>line: &nbsp;<em>Rogues' Gallery</em> is shaping up to be both awesome addition to the world of New Corinth, but also a fantastic set of baddies. &nbsp; Sawbones' voice comes out spectacularly, which makes the book a really fun read.</p>",
